    <TD STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&nbsp;</FONT></TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; vertical-align: top">
    <TD STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">2.</FONT></TD>
    <TD STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&nbsp;</FONT></TD>
    <TD STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><B>RESOLVED,
    AS A SPECIAL RESOLUTION, THAT</B>, subject to and conditional upon the approval of the Registrar of Companies in the Cayman Islands
    (the &ldquo;Cayman Registrar&rdquo;), the name of the Company be changed from &ldquo;CHIJET MOTOR COMPANY, INC.&rdquo; to &ldquo;Digital
    Currency X Technology Inc.&rdquo;, with effect from the date of the certificate of incorporation on change of name to be issued by
    the Cayman Registrar (the &ldquo;Change of Name&rdquo;).</FONT></TD>
    <TD STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&nbsp;</FONT></TD>
